Python agent harness scaffold. Replace the sample package and tests with local contracts.

```sh
python3 -m venv .venv
.venv/bin/python -m pip install -e '.[dev]'
git init
.venv/bin/pre-commit install
.venv/bin/pre-commit install --hook-type pre-push
